parent 153ddb7c6326ada5b77ae44d616e81098715abdb
author Semen <semen@metric.xyz> 1781638699 +0000
committer Semen <semen@metric.xyz> 1781699339 +0000

refactor: price-provider clarity renames + drop LazerConsumer USD conversion

Readability renames (no behavior change):
- cexStep -> marginStep (state/setter/event/error) across all providers,
  interfaces and factories
- Anchored feed ids: offchainFeedId -> baseFeedId, refFeedId -> quoteFeedId
- Anchored spread: u -> spreadBps, U_MAX -> MAX_SPREAD_BPS, uMax -> maxSpreadBps
  (+ envelope/error names)
- Anchored FLOOR -> minMargin (the per-side minimum margin), FloorZero ->
  MinMarginZero (+ envelope names)

LazerConsumer: remove the USD/USDT conversion feed. Every feed is parsed
uniformly and stored at 8 decimals as-is (no division by a USDT rate); cross-quote
conversion is handled by AnchoredPriceProvider's synthetic ratio feed. Drops
USD_CONVERTION_FEED_ID and the WrongUsdtFeedId/InvalidUsdtPrice errors, the
PythOracle constructor arg (version -> 0.0.8), and the deploy-config field.
